# Not part of this deployment — excluded so a local `vercel deploy` doesn't
# try to upload their build artifacts (acalink/build/ alone has files over
# 300MB, well past Vercel's 100MB per-file limit). The GitHub-integrated
# deploy never hit this because it clones fresh from git, which already
# excludes these via their own nested .gitignore files; this file makes the
# CLI path behave the same way.
acalink
functions
demo
